##  Step 0: Pre-check (what already exists?)
Before creating anything I checked the VPC dashboard.

- Found only **one VPC with an empty name and "Default VPC: Yes"** (`172.31.0.0/16`) with 3 default subnets.
- This was the **default VPC**, not a custom one, and all its subnets are public.
- Decision: **do not touch the default VPC**; build a fresh custom VPC for this lab.

# `images/00-default-vpc.png`

> **Lesson:** Always verify the VPC ID, name and CIDR before creating resources.

