##  Testing and Proof
Commands run **inside** `private-ec2`:

```bash
curl -I https://google.com
```
Result: `HTTP/2 301` → the private instance reached the internet.

```bash
curl -s https://checkip.amazonaws.com
```
Result: `13.50.152.189` → this is the **Elastic IP of the NAT Gateway**, proving outbound traffic leaves through NAT.

 #`images/14-curl-test-output.png`

